              "content": "Uses semantic search to find the closest matching organizations for a given name. Optionally filter by headquarters location. Returns up to 10 results ranked by similarity score. Deducts 1 credit per request.\n\n`result_count` must be between 1 and 10 (inclusive).\n\n**Errors**\n- `400` — `result_count` is out of the allowed range.\n- `402` — Insufficient credits.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
